# tools/motion_compare.py, case "menus": every top-level page of the menu (after tests/newgame.pad, with
# --cheats all, so the lists are full). <vblank> <buttons> [vblanks held]; the player has control from 1800.
# The pages fade in and out over about 30 vblanks: presses are 60 apart.
1800 CIRCLE 4     # the menu (it fades in over the game)
1860 CROSS 4      # Item
1920 DOWN 4       # the second item
1980 RIGHT 4      # the next page
2040 CIRCLE 4     # back to the menu
2100 DOWN 4
2160 CROSS 4      # Magic
2220 DOWN 4
2280 CIRCLE 4
2340 DOWN 4
2400 CROSS 4      # Equipment: the weapon's slot
2460 RIGHT 4      # a weapon put on: its model in the box, the body beside it
2520 RIGHT 4      # the next weapon
2580 SQUARE 4     # the list
2640 CIRCLE 4     # out of the list and the page
2760 DOWN 4
2820 CROSS 4      # Status
2880 CIRCLE 4
2940 DOWN 4
3000 CROSS 4      # Journal
3060 CROSS 4
3120 CIRCLE 4
3180 CIRCLE 4
3240 DOWN 4
3300 CROSS 4      # Arrange
3360 CIRCLE 4
3420 DOWN 4
3480 CROSS 4      # System
3540 CROSS 4
3600 CIRCLE 4
3660 CIRCLE 4
3720 CIRCLE 4     # the menu closed
